# Sprint 5 — Closed Alpha Launch

**Full spec:** `docs/sprints/SPRINT_5_CLOSED_ALPHA_LAUNCH.md`

## Mission

Closed Alpha **30 users** operable. UI minimal. Focus: **Login · Workspace · AI PM · Admin · Analytics · Stability**.

## Non-negotiable order

1. **Epic A** (Google OAuth + P0-6~9 validation)
2. **Release Checklist** — `docs/RELEASE_CHECKLIST.md` all PASS
3. **Epic E** verify (analytics persistence)
4. **Epic B + C** (Real AI PM + Workspace)
5. **Epic D + F** (Admin ops center + stabilization)
6. **Epic G** (Smart questions) — last only

## CPO gates (every change)

- Workspace user always knows **what to do next** — no dead ends
- AI PM **works & reports** — not generic chat praise
- **No silent mock** — real pipeline or visible `[Sample]` label
- **Unmeasured = unfinished** — `recordFunnelEvent()` for new behavior
- Exit = **alpha openable**, not just green build

## Do NOT

- Add landing redesign or unrelated UI polish
- Import Supabase/OpenAI SDK in `apps/` or `packages/core`
- Skip OAuth regression after auth changes
- Commit unless user explicitly requests

## Key files

- Auth: `apps/web/lib/auth/update-session.ts`
- Workspace: `apps/web/features/my-projects/components/v2-authenticated-workspace.tsx`
- Mock to replace: `buildSampleInvestigationContext()` in authenticated path
- Analytics: `apps/web/lib/analytics/server/analytics-persistence.ts`, migration `022_analytics_events.sql`
- Admin: `apps/web/features/operations/components/admin-*`
